  "answer_key": "UPDATE subscriber_boxes SET final_price = final_price * 0.85 WHERE box_month >= (SELECT MIN(b.box_month) FROM subscriber_boxes b WHERE b.customer_id = subscriber_boxes.customer_id) + INTERVAL '6 months'; SELECT * FROM subscriber_boxes ORDER BY customer_id, box_month;",
